          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your last action was a missed Strike with a melee unarmed attack.</p><hr /><p>You have trained rigorously to use all parts of your body as a weapon, and when you miss with an attack, you can usually continue the attack with a different body part and still deal damage. Make another Strike with a melee unarmed attack, using the same multiple attack penalty as the missed Strike, if any.</p>"
          },
